{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:42:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_7390fd2e348249f28f634b04a0100852","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_15fb0436c39a19e24c9b79c6ca7854bafdad0e0a00ce4dfa8616107cb93ca7b0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"coleam00/linear-coding-agent-harness@c37dc0969930 snapshot d9f454e04233bbea","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5590f691321c89e948dbe0ae744c8846de20e82479680110a4c21e3f52658bff","slc_e76a618697e8e34cc182e5532ecbd6b13250c50967a13f51abff276864ea0fcd"],"source_ids":["src_bc2e5fda244d528ea96fecdc30fd33e8"],"text":"The demo implements a two-agent pattern: an initializer agent that sets up the Linear project and issues, and a coding agent that implements them.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:42:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7390fd2e348249f28f634b04a0100852"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:42:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_7390fd2e348249f28f634b04a0100852","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2ca5c2316937bebc9d8de3e618d020ba99a37b6f0cd8df11f414401fa12b84a4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"coleam00/linear-coding-agent-harness@c37dc0969930 snapshot d9f454e04233bbea","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_76d0e77b2e896ad1a7d82ee12a20bf9b03f39374a166c650494ca4b4f79ff5fe"],"source_ids":["src_bc2e5fda244d528ea96fecdc30fd33e8"],"text":"The repository includes modules for agent session logic, Claude SDK/MCP client configuration, security validation, progress tracking, prompt loading, and Linear configuration constants, plus prompt files for both agent roles.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:42:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7390fd2e348249f28f634b04a0100852"}
